{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}

{% block seo %}
    {{ include('_seo.html.twig', {
        title: 'Secret Santa - Privacy Policy',
        description: 'Privacy Policy of the website',
    }) }}
{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
    <div class="content-container">
        <div class="content">
            <h1 class="content-head is-center">Privacy Policy</h1>

            <p>
                Your privacy is important to us. It is JoliCode's policy to respect your privacy
                regarding any information we may collect from you across our website,
                <a href="{{ url('homepage') }}">{{ url('homepage') }}</a>, and other sites we own
                and operate.
            </p>

            <p>
                We only ask for personal information when we truly need it to provide a service to
                you. We collect it by fair and lawful means, with your knowledge and consent.
                We also let you know why we’re collecting it and how it will be used.
            </p>

            <h2>Data collected from Slack, Discord and Webex</h2>

            <p>
                When you connect your workspace, Secret Santa reads the following data through the
                platform API, and uses it only to organize the draw:
            </p>

            <ul>
                <li>
                    <strong>Your account</strong> (identifier, name and avatar) and the name of your
                    workspace, to identify you as the organizer and display them during the setup.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>The members of your workspace</strong> (identifier, name and avatar), to let
                    you pick the participants. On Slack, when you restrict the draw to some channels,
                    only the names of the channels you are a member of and the members of the channels
                    you selected are read, including the members from other workspaces in Slack
                    Connect channels.
                </li>
                <li>
                    <strong>Your user groups</strong> (Slack) and <strong>roles</strong> (Discord), to help
                    you select the participants faster.
                </li>
            </ul>

            <p>
                Secret Santa never reads the messages of your channels. It only sends direct messages:
                the draw result to every participant, with the optional message you wrote, and a
                summary to you as the organizer. The names of the participants are also encoded
                in the spoil code sent to the organizer, so that the draw can be looked up later.
            </p>

            <p>
                We only retain collected information for as long as necessary to provide you with
                your requested service. The collected information will be automatically deleted a
                few hours after your last interaction with our service. You will then not be able to
                access, nor request for modification or deletion of these information because
                everything will be already deleted.
            </p>

            <p>
                For every data we collect, we’ll protect within commercially acceptable means to prevent
                loss and theft, as well as unauthorised access, disclosure, copying, use or
                modification.
            </p>

            <p>
                We don’t share any personally identifying information publicly or with
                third-parties, except when required to by law.
            </p>

            <p>
                Our website may link to external sites that are not operated by us. Please be aware
                that we have no control over the content and practices of these sites, and cannot
                accept responsibility or liability for their respective privacy policies.
            </p>

            <p>
                You are free to refuse our request for your personal information, with the
                understanding that we may be unable to provide you with some of your desired
                services.
            </p>

            <p>
                Your continued use of our website will be regarded as acceptance of our practices
                around privacy and personal information. If you have any questions about how we
                handle user data and personal information, feel free to contact us.
            </p>

            <p>
                This policy is effective as of 31 October 2026.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
{% endblock content %}
